Package: equivR
Title: Reproducible Cross-Runtime Equivalence for R Analytics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yonglin", "Zhu", , "zhuygln@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0245-827X")),
    person("Xing", "Cai", , "caixingtt@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-5983-3338"))
  )
Description: Validates whether a candidate analytical implementation reproduces
    the data results of a trusted reference under an explicit, versioned
    equivalence contract. Acceptance is deterministic and fail-closed: a
    candidate passes only when every required check passes, and every
    result carries machine-readable diagnostics and artifact checksums.
